    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've tried all that. meditation, therapy, everything. nothing works. it's like i'm trapped in a room with a million screaming voices and no door. it just feels like the only way to actually get that silence i'm talking about is to just... stop. to just not be here anymore. because as long as i'm here, the noise is here. wouldn't it be easier if it was just over?",
